[{"id":2575365054,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6ZgPO-","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?u=f7f8e0273f784f5ec6f6b7fe4a88d449896eb48a&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Your implementation is perfectly fine.\r\nAs a proposed solution to the problem, it's acceptable, but I think the solution I'd prefer would be to change the `print_verbose` macro to a function:\r\n```c++\r\ntemplate <typename... Args>\r\nvoid print_verbose(const Variant &p_var, Args... p_args) {\r\n\tif (is_print_verbose_enabled()) {\r\n\t\tprint_line(p_var, p_args...);\r\n\t}\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nI have no idea why the snippet was made a macro in the first place (premature optimization?), but we can see now that it being one has led to awkward workarounds.\r\n","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102062#pullrequestreview-2575365054","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102062","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102062#pullrequestreview-2575365054"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102062"}},"submitted_at":"2025-01-27T12:56:00Z","commit_id":null},{"id":2575506717,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6Zgx0d","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?u=f7f8e0273f784f5ec6f6b7fe4a88d449896eb48a&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"> I do agree on capitalization for macros, mind you that approach might be subject to more push back (as the change is less localized), and will require rebasing existing PRs that use print_verbose.\r\n\r\nAgreed.\r\nI see no reason to block this PR over there being another, possibly contentious solution. Your solution is self contained and unproblematic. The priority is fixing the bug, so I'm happy to approve.\r\n\r\n> I wouldn't be surprised if this was historically a function and later changed to a macro for the string concat efficiency.\r\n\r\nI looked it up, that's correct!\r\n\r\n> Probably better for a separate PR though, so preferred approach can be chosen in a meeting.\r\n\r\nAgreed!","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102062#pullrequestreview-2575506717","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/r